#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Ejecución de código {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr "Haz clic en **Run** en cualquier bloque de código. El primer clic inicia un kernel Jupyter a través de [Binder](https://mybinder.org) o [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). Después de eso, las ejecuciones son instantáneas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — Enable [Simulator Mode](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode) to run all notebooks with AerSimulator or noise-model FakeBackends. Zero setup required.\n"
msgstr "**Modo Simulador (sin cuenta necesaria)** — Activa el [Modo Simulador](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode) para ejecutar todos los notebooks con AerSimulator o FakeBackends con modelos de ruido. Sin configuración requerida.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in [Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-injected on every run. [Create a free account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have one.\n"
msgstr "**Hardware Cuántico de IBM** — Ingresa tu token de API y CRN en [Configuración](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) una vez: las credenciales se inyectan automáticamente en cada ejecución. [Crea una cuenta gratuita](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) si no tienes una.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Backends de ejecución disponibles</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr "Cada tutorial tiene bloques de código ejecutables. Haz clic en **Run** para ejecutarlos usando uno de cuatro backends:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr "**Binder** (predeterminado en GitHub Pages) — Kernel Jupyter remoto gratuito a través de [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-engine)\n"
msgstr "**IBM Code Engine** — Jupyter serverless en tu cuenta de IBM Cloud. Arranque en frío en segundos en lugar de minutos. [Configurar](/jupyter-settings#code-engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr "**Jupyter Local (Docker / RasQberry)** — Se conecta al servidor Jupyter local con Qiskit preinstalado\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr "**Servidor personalizado** — Apunta a cualquier endpoint Jupyter en [Configuración](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from [Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr "Cuando hay múltiples backends disponibles, elige cuál usar desde [Configuración](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Opciones de despliegue</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "doQumentation está disponible como:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr "**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Sitio estático con [Binder](https://mybinder.org) o [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine) para ejecución de código remota\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)** — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr "**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)** — Stack completo localmente, capaz de funcionar sin conexión\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted on Raspberry Pi with local Jupyter kernel\n"
msgstr "**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Auto-hospedado en Raspberry Pi con kernel Jupyter local\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Run locally with Podman / Docker</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Ejecutar localmente con Podman / Docker</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) or [Docker Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / Linux), then run:\n"
msgstr "Instala [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) o [Docker Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / Linux), luego ejecuta:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — code execution works locally, no Binder wait time.\n"
msgstr "Abre [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080): la ejecución de código funciona localmente, sin tiempo de espera de Binder.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a lightweight version without local code execution (~60 MB):\n"
msgstr "Para una versión ligera sin ejecución de código local (~60 MB):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using Docker instead? Just replace `podman` with `docker` — the commands are identical. Images are multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), so Apple Silicon Macs work natively.\n"
msgstr "¿Usas Docker en su lugar? Simplemente reemplaza `podman` por `docker`: los comandos son idénticos. Las imágenes son multi-arquitectura (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), por lo que las Mac con Apple Silicon funcionan nativamente.\n"
